n      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.85\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n    starcoder_test_hard:\n      random_R1_mean: 0.574\n      random_R1_ci:\n      - 0.566\n      - 0.582\n      embedding_R1_mean: 0.589\n      embedding_R1_ci:\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.598\n      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.572\n      dataflow_R1_ci:\n      - 0.562\n      - 0.582\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n      dataflow_minus_random_pp: -0.2\n    starcoder_test_easy:\n      random_R1_mean: 0.812\n      embedding_R1_mean: 0.822\n      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.81\n    repobench_R1_delta_pp_embedding_avg: 1.8\n    bootstrap_CI_width_R1_pp_avg: 1.2\n  result_rationale: 'RepoBench-R 是 cross-file completion 任务，pool 更小（6-18），绝对 R@1 更高。\n    Embedding mining 在两个 encoder 上均显著提升 test_hard R@1（Qwen +2.1pp, StarCoder +1.5pp），\n    因为 pool=18 仍有足够 distractors 使 mining 质量差异体现。Test_easy pool=6 接近 ceiling，delta\n    被压缩但方向一致。Dataflow 在 Qwen test_hard 上 +1.2pp 但 CI 刚好 排除零，StarCoder 上无效（-0.2pp，CI\n    含零）——与 SWE-smith 上的 encoder-strategy interaction 完全一致，说明 pattern 跨 benchmark 稳定。CI\n    宽度 ~1.2pp 在 bootstrap_CI_width_R1_pp [0.5, 2.0] 范围内，9 seeds 提供足够统计功效。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: RepoBench-R Results (test_hard, pool≈18)'","numLines":150,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1176}}}
