{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ThdrdQDskJvYfj7GCHJ2ak","type":"tool_result","content":"150\t  - name: 'Table 5: RepoBench-R Results (test_hard, pool≈18)'\n151\t    columns:\n152\t    - Encoder\n153\t    - Strategy\n154\t    - R@1 (%)\n155\t    - 95% CI\n156\t    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n157\t    rows:\n158\t    - - Qwen\n159\t      - random\n160\t      - 62.1\n161\t      - '[61.4, 62.8]'\n162\t      - —\n163\t    - - Qwen\n164\t      - embedding\n165\t      - 64.2\n166\t      - '[63.4, 65.0]'\n167\t      - '+2.1'\n168\t    - - Qwen\n169\t      - dataflow\n170\t      - 63.3\n171\t      - '[62.4, 64.2]'\n172\t      - '+1.2'\n173\t    - - StarCoder\n174\t      - random\n175\t      - 57.4\n176\t      - '[56.6, 58.2]'\n177\t      - —\n178\t    - - StarCoder\n179\t      - embedding\n180\t      - 58.9\n181\t      - '[58.0, 59.8]'\n182\t      - '+1.5'\n183\t    - - StarCoder\n184\t      - dataflow\n185\t      - 57.2\n186\t      - '[56.2, 58.2]'\n187\t      - −0.2\n188\t  figures_description:\n189\t  - 'Fig 6: RepoBench-R R@1 grouped bar chart (2 encoders × 3 strategies) with CI\n190\t    whiskers, test_easy vs test_hard side by side'\n191\t  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark 一致性是 best tier 的关键证据：embedding mining 在 SWE-smith 和 RepoBench-R\n192\t    上均显著提升两个 encoder，dataflow 条件性获益仅限 Qwen。这排除了 \"结果仅限单一 benchmark\" 的 reviewer concern。Test_easy\n193\t    上 delta 被压缩（pool=6 ceiling effect）是预期行为，反向验证了 pool size 对绝对效果幅度的调节作用。\n194\t\n195\t    '\n196\t- name: Stratified Analysis with Structural Coverage & Neg Difficulty Quartiles\n197\t  plan_id: plan_005\n198\t  description: '5 层分层分析：repo size / pool size / query-positive similarity / structural\n199\t    data availability (34% vs 66%) / neg_difficulty quartile。使用 M2 best checkpoints\n200\t    在 SWE-smith validation 上重新评估。\n201\t\n202\t    '\n203\t  expected_results:\n204\t    stratum_structural_available:\n205\t      with_dataflow_34pct:\n206\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 2.8\n207\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_embedding_pp: 1.3\n208\t        starcoder_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.1\n209\t        n_instances: ~5200\n210\t      fallback_66pct:\n211\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.1\n212\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_embedding_pp: -0.2\n213\t        starcoder_dataflow_minus_random_pp: -0.3\n214\t        n_instances: ~10000\n215\t    stratum_neg_difficulty_quartile:\n216\t      Q1_easiest:\n217\t        qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.8\n218\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.3\n219\t      Q2:\n220\t        qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n221\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.7\n222\t      Q3:\n223\t        qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.4\n224\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n225\t      Q4_hardest:\n226\t        qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 3.2\n227\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 2.1\n228\t    stratum_repo_size:\n229\t      small_lt50:\n230\t        embedding_delta_pp: 2.8\n231\t        n: ~500\n232\t      medium_50_200:\n233\t        embedding_delta_pp: 2.2\n234\t        n: ~4100\n235\t      large_200_500:\n236\t        embedding_delta_pp: 1.8\n237\t        n: ~5500\n238\t      xlarge_500plus:\n239\t        embedding_delta_pp: 1.6\n240\t        n: ~5100\n241\t    stratum_pool_size:\n242\t      pool_lt20:\n243\t        embedding_delta_pp: 1.0\n244\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.3\n245\t      pool_20_50:\n246\t        embedding_delta_pp: 2.1\n247\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 1.0\n248\t      pool_gt50:\n249\t        embedding_delta_pp: 2.5\n250\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 1.4\n251\t    stratum_query_pos_sim:\n252\t      high_sim_gt095:\n253\t        embedding_delta_pp: 2.6\n254\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 1.8\n255\t      medium_sim_085_095:\n256\t        embedding_delta_pp: 1.9\n257\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.8\n258\t      low_sim_lt085:\n259\t        embedding_delta_pp: 1.2\n260\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.2\n261\t  result_rationale: 'Structural-available stratum（34%）上 dataflow 优势放大到 +2.8pp（Qwen），因为这些\n262\t    instance 实际接收了 dataflow-disconnected negatives——真实训练信号未被 fallback 稀释。 Fallback\n263\t    stratum（66%）上 dataflow ≈ embedding（±0.2pp），因为 fallback 时 dataflow 策略退化为 embedding\n264\t    或 random 选择，无结构信号注入。这一分解直接回应 reviewer 关于 \"34% coverage 稀释 signal\" 的 concern——真实\n265\t    per-instance 效果是 +2.8pp 而非 pooled +1.0pp。Neg_difficulty Q4（最难 quartile）上 delta\n266\t    最大（embedding +3.2pp, dataflow +2.1pp），符合 representation saturation 理论——Qwen 在高\n267\t    pos_sim 区域最需要 harder negatives，而 Q4 恰好是 margin 最小、分辨最难的 instances。Q1（最容易）delta\n268\t    最小 因为 random negatives 已经足够容易区分。Repo size 上 small repo delta 更大因为 小 repo 的 candidate\n269\t    pool 更集中，mining 策略差异更容易体现。\n270\t\n271\t    '\n272\t  tables:\n273\t  - name: 'Table 7: Stratified R@1 Delta by Structural Data Availability (Qwen)'\n274\t    columns:\n275\t    - Stratum\n276\t    - N\n277\t    - random R@1\n278\t    - embedding R@1\n279\t    - dataflow R@1\n280\t    - df−rand (pp)\n281\t    rows:\n282\t    - - With dataflow (34%)\n283\t      - ~5.2K\n284\t      - 53.1\n285\t      - 55.4\n286\t      - 55.9\n287\t      - '+2.8'\n288\t    - - Fallback (66%)\n289\t      - ~10K\n290\t      - 55.2\n291\t      - 57.3\n292\t      - 55.3\n293\t      - '+0.1'\n294\t    - - Overall\n295\t      - ~15.2K\n296\t      - 54.5\n297\t      - 56.5\n298\t      - 55.5\n299\t      - '+1.0'\n300\t  - name: 'Table 7b: R@1 Delta by Neg Difficulty Quartile (Qwen)'\n301\t    columns:\n302\t    - Quartile\n303\t    - margin_mean\n304\t    - emb−rand (pp)\n305\t    - df−rand (pp)\n306\t    rows:\n307\t    - - Q1 (easiest)\n308\t      - 0.142\n309\t      - '+0.8'\n310\t      - '+0.3'\n311\t    - - Q2\n312\t      - 0.078\n313\t      - '+1.5'\n314\t      - '+0.7'\n315\t    - - Q3\n316\t      - 0.031\n317\t      - '+2.4'\n318\t      - '+1.2'\n319\t    - - Q4 (hardest)\n320\t      - 0.008\n321\t      - '+3.2'\n322\t      - '+2.1'\n323\t  figures_description:\n324\t  - 'Fig 7: Heatmap — R@1 delta (strategy × stratum), separate panels for Qwen and\n325\t    StarCoder'\n326\t  - 'Fig 8: Neg difficulty quartile vs R@1 delta line plot, 3 strategies overlaid'\n327\t  analysis: 'Stratified analysis 提供了论文中最强的 mechanistic 证据。Neg_difficulty Q4 的 +3.2pp\n328\t    embedding delta 是 overall +2.0pp 的 1.6 倍——越难的 instances 从 harder negatives 获益越多，这是\n329\t    representation saturation 理论的直接预测。Structural-available vs fallback 分解消除了 \"diluted\n330\t    signal\" concern 并揭示 dataflow 的真实 per-instance 效果（+2.8pp）远大于 pooled 报告值。\n331\t\n332\t    '\n333\t- name: Call-Graph Hop Depth Ablation (1/2/3-hop)\n334\t  plan_id: plan_007\n335\t  description: '比较 1-hop / 2-hop / 3-hop call-graph bounding 对 dataflow negative 质量的影响。\n336\t    Qwen encoder, 1 seed, SWE-smith validation。\n337\t\n338\t    '\n339\t  expected_results:\n340\t    hop_1:\n341\t      R1: 0.548\n342\t      connected_coverage_pct: 12.4\n343\t      negatives_per_query_mean: 18.2\n344\t    hop_2:\n345\t      R1: 0.555\n346\t      connected_coverage_pct: 34.3\n347\t      negatives_per_query_mean: 31.7\n348\t    hop_3:\n349\t      R1: 0.551\n350\t      connected_coverage_pct: 58.6\n351\t      negatives_per_query_mean: 42.1\n352\t    optimal_hop: 2\n353\t    hop2_minus_hop1_pp: 0.7\n354\t    hop3_minus_hop2_pp: -0.4\n355\t  result_rationale: '2-hop 是最优平衡点。1-hop 太保守——仅 12.4% coverage 意味着大部分 instance 没有足够的\n356\t    connected 节点来定义 \"disconnected\" negatives，退化为 random。3-hop 过于宽松——58.6% coverage\n357\t    下 \"disconnected\" 的定义变得太窄，许多语义相关但间接连接的文件被错误排除在 negative pool 外，引入噪声。2-hop 的 34.3%\n358\t    coverage（与 M1 extraction 的 structural data rate 一致）在 \"enough connected nodes to\n359\t    define meaningful disconnection\" 和 \"disconnected set still contains genuinely\n360\t    unrelated files\" 之间取得平衡。\n361\t\n362\t    '\n363\t  tables:\n364\t  - name: 'Table 9: Hop Depth Ablation (Qwen, dataflow strategy)'\n365\t    columns:\n366\t    - Hops\n367\t    - Coverage (%)\n368\t    - Neg/query\n369\t    - R@1 (%)\n370\t    - Δ vs 2-hop (pp)\n371\t    rows:\n372\t    - - 1\n373\t      - 12.4\n374\t      - 18.2\n375\t      - 54.8\n376\t      - −0.7\n377\t    - - 2\n378\t      - 34.3\n379\t      - 31.7\n380\t      - 55.5\n381\t      - —\n382\t    - - 3\n383\t      - 58.6\n384\t      - 42.1\n385\t      - 55.1\n386\t      - −0.4\n387\t  figures_description:\n388\t  - 'Fig S1: Hop depth vs R@1 line plot with coverage % on secondary y-axis'\n389\t  analysis: '2-hop optimal 符合 inter-procedural dataflow 的语义：1-hop = 直接 caller/callee，\n390\t    2-hop = caller 的 caller 或 callee 的 callee（一层间接调用），3-hop 开始包含 过于间接的关系。论文可以强调 2-hop\n391\t    选择有 principled 依据而非纯粹 empirical tuning。\n392\t\n393\t    '\n394\t- name: Training Data Size Scaling (1K/3K/5K)\n395\t  plan_id: plan_008\n396\t  description: '固定 Qwen encoder + embedding strategy，训练数据从 1K / 3K / 5K instances\n397\t    增长， 观察 R@1 变化和策略排名稳定性。\n398\t\n399\t    '\n400\t  expected_results:\n401\t    size_1K:\n402\t      random_R1: 0.51\n403\t      embedding_R1: 0.522\n404\t      dataflow_R1: 0.515\n405\t      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n406\t      seed_std: 0.015\n407\t    size_3K:\n408\t      random_R1: 0.532\n409\t      embedding_R1: 0.55\n410\t      dataflow_R1: 0.541\n411\t      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.8\n412\t      seed_std: 0.01\n413\t    size_5K:\n414\t      random_R1: 0.545\n415\t      embedding_R1: 0.565\n416\t      dataflow_R1: 0.555\n417\t      embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.0\n418\t      seed_std: 0.008\n419\t    ranking_stable: true\n420\t    monotonic_improvement: true\n421\t  result_rationale: '策略排名在 1K/3K/5K 三个尺度上保持一致（embedding > dataflow > random），但 delta\n422\t    幅度随数据量增大而增大——1K 时 +1.2pp，5K 时 +2.0pp。这是因为更大的训练集提供更多 diverse negatives，使 mining\n423\t    策略的差异更充分地体现。1K 时 seed 方差较大（std=0.015） 因为 negative 多样性不足，个别 seed 的 negative 采样偶然性影响结果。5K\n424\t    时方差收敛 （std=0.008），mining 策略的信号超过采样噪声。No diminishing returns at 5K suggests further\n425\t    scaling could help, but is beyond scope。\n426\t\n427\t    '\n428\t  tables:\n429\t  - name: 'Table 10: Data Size Scaling (Qwen)'\n430\t    columns:\n431\t    - Size\n432\t    - random R@1\n433\t    - embedding R@1\n434\t    - dataflow R@1\n435\t    - emb−rand (pp)\n436\t    - σ across seeds\n437\t    rows:\n438\t    - - 1K\n439\t      - 51.0\n440\t      - 52.2\n441\t      - 51.5\n442\t      - '+1.2'\n443\t      - 1.5\n444\t    - - 3K\n445\t      - 53.2\n446\t      - 55.0\n447\t      - 54.1\n448\t      - '+1.8'\n449\t      - 1.0\n450\t    - - 5K\n451\t      - 54.5\n452\t      - 56.5\n453\t      - 55.5\n454\t      - '+2.0'\n455\t      - 0.8\n456\t  figures_description:\n457\t  - 'Fig S2: R@1 vs training size for 3 strategies, with shaded seed variance bands'\n458\t  analysis: 'Monotonic scaling + stable ranking 表明结果不是 small-data artifact。5K 时未见\n459\t    diminishing returns，暗示更大数据集可能进一步放大差异。这对 reviewer \"effect size marginal\" concern\n460\t    有价值——delta 仍在增长，当前 +2.0pp 是下界而非上界。\n461\t\n462\t    '\n463\t- name: Fusion Head Ablation\n464\t  plan_id: plan_009\n465\t  description: '比较 embedding-only / structural-features-only / combined fusion head，\n466\t    隔离 training-time mining 价值与 inference-time feature injection。\n467\t\n468\t    '\n469\t  expected_results:\n470\t    embedding_only:\n471\t      qwen_R1: 0.565\n472\t      starcoder_R1: 0.475\n473\t    structural_features_only:\n474\t      qwen_R1: 0.498\n475\t      starcoder_R1: 0.421\n476\t    combined_fusion:\n477\t      qwen_R1: 0.561\n478\t      starcoder_R1: 0.472\n479\t    embedding_only_minus_combined_pp: 0.4\n480\t    conclusion: mining > fusion; structural features at inference add noise\n481\t  result_rationale: 'Embedding-only（仅用 embedding mining 训练的 retriever，inference 时不注入结构特征）\n482\t    表现最好或 tied with combined。Combined fusion 略低 0.4pp 因为 inference-time structural\n483\t    features 引入了不精确的 CodeQL connectivity 信号——recall 某些 CodeQL extraction 失败的 instance\n484\t    反而被错误降权。Structural-features-only（不用 mining 训练， 仅在 inference 注入结构特征）远低于 embedding-only（-6.7pp\n485\t    Qwen），证明核心价值在 training-time negative mining 而非 inference-time feature engineering。\n486\t    这一结果对 paper framing 极为重要：StructFuse 的贡献是 mining strategy，不是 fusion。\n487\t\n488\t    '\n489\t  tables:\n490\t  - name: 'Table 11: Fusion Head Ablation'\n491\t    columns:\n492\t    - Configuration\n493\t    - Qwen R@1 (%)\n494\t    - StarCoder R@1 (%)\n495\t    rows:\n496\t    - - embedding-only (ours)\n497\t      - 56.5\n498\t      - 47.5\n499\t    - - structural-features-only\n500\t      - 49.8\n501\t      - 42.1\n502\t    - - combined fusion\n503\t      - 56.1\n504\t      - 47.2\n505\t  figures_description:\n506\t  - 'Fig S3: Ablation bar chart comparing 3 fusion configurations'\n507\t  analysis: '训练时注入 structural signal 通过 negative mining（间接信号）比 inference 时直接注入 structural\n508\t    features（直接信号）更有效。可能原因：mining 让 encoder 自己学习结构相关的 representation，而直接注入 features\n509\t    绕过了 encoder 的学习过程，且 CodeQL 34% coverage 意味着 66% instance 在 inference 时收到 zero-vector\n510\t    structural features，引入 noise。\n511\t\n512\t    '\n513\t- name: Dataflow-Distance Weighted vs Binary Negatives\n514\t  plan_id: plan_010\n515\t  description: '比较 binary connected/disconnected 与 dataflow-distance weighted negative\n516\t    sampling。 Weighted: disconnected 且 hop-distance 更远的文件被赋予更高采样概率。\n517\t\n518\t    '\n519\t  expected_results:\n520\t    binary_qwen_R1: 0.555\n521\t    weighted_qwen_R1: 0.558\n522\t    binary_starcoder_R1: 0.458\n523\t    weighted_starcoder_R1: 0.459\n524\t    weighted_minus_binary_qwen_pp: 0.3\n525\t    weighted_minus_binary_starcoder_pp: 0.1\n526\t  result_rationale: 'Weighted 在 Qwen 上仅微弱提升 +0.3pp（不显著），StarCoder 上几乎无差异。 原因：binary\n527\t    disconnected/connected 已经捕获了最关键的 structural distinction—— \"是否在调用链上\"。进一步按 hop distance\n528\t    加权引入的额外信号被 noise 抵消：距离更远 不一定意味着更好的 negative（一个完全无关的 utility 文件可能 hop=∞ 但也是 trivial\n529\t    negative）。 Binary 的简洁性是优势——fewer hyperparameters, same effect。\n530\t\n531\t    '\n532\t  tables:\n533\t  - name: 'Table S1: Weighted vs Binary Dataflow Negatives'\n534\t    columns:\n535\t    - Method\n536\t    - Qwen R@1 (%)\n537\t    - StarCoder R@1 (%)\n538\t    - Δ vs Binary (pp)\n539\t    rows:\n540\t    - - Binary (default)\n541\t      - 55.5\n542\t      - 45.8\n543\t      - —\n544\t    - - Distance-weighted\n545\t      - 55.8\n546\t      - 45.9\n547\t      - +0.3 / +0.1\n548\t  figures_description: []\n549\t  analysis: 'Binary is sufficient — complexity of weighted sampling not justified."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4036345-91c5-47f2-9c09-36d0f1b82314","uuid":"d1f9e26f-1f18-410f-a056-ce051a0f88bc","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:07:34.707Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T162530/best/imagined_experiments.yaml","content":"  - name: 'Table 5: RepoBench-R Results (test_hard, pool≈18)'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - Strategy\n    - R@1 (%)\n    - 95% CI\n    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - random\n      - 62.1\n      - '[61.4, 62.8]'\n      - —\n    - - Qwen\n      - embedding\n      - 64.2\n      - '[63.4, 65.0]'\n      - '+2.1'\n    - - Qwen\n      - dataflow\n      - 63.3\n      - '[62.4, 64.2]'\n      - '+1.2'\n    - - StarCoder\n      - random\n      - 57.4\n      - '[56.6, 58.2]'\n      - —\n    - - StarCoder\n      - embedding\n      - 58.9\n      - '[58.0, 59.8]'\n      - '+1.5'\n    - - StarCoder\n      - dataflow\n      - 57.2\n      - '[56.2, 58.2]'\n      - −0.2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6: RepoBench-R R@1 grouped bar chart (2 encoders × 3 strategies) with CI\n    whiskers, test_easy vs test_hard side by side'\n  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark 一致性是 best tier 的关键证据：embedding mining 在 SWE-smith 和 RepoBench-R\n    上均显著提升两个 encoder，dataflow 条件性获益仅限 Qwen。这排除了 \"结果仅限单一 benchmark\" 的 reviewer concern。Test_easy\n    上 delta 被压缩（pool=6 ceiling effect）是预期行为，反向验证了 pool size 对绝对效果幅度的调节作用。\n\n    '\n- name: Stratified Analysis with Structural Coverage & Neg Difficulty Quartiles\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '5 层分层分析：repo size / pool size / query-positive similarity / structural\n    data availability (34% vs 66%) / neg_difficulty quartile。使用 M2 best checkpoints\n    在 SWE-smith validation 上重新评估。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    stratum_structural_available:\n      with_dataflow_34pct:\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 2.8\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_embedding_pp: 1.3\n        starcoder_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.1\n        n_instances: ~5200\n      fallback_66pct:\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.1\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_embedding_pp: -0.2\n        starcoder_dataflow_minus_random_pp: -0.3\n        n_instances: ~10000\n    stratum_neg_difficulty_quartile:\n      Q1_easiest:\n        qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.8\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.3\n      Q2:\n        qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.7\n      Q3:\n        qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.4\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n      Q4_hardest:\n        qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 3.2\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 2.1\n    stratum_repo_size:\n      small_lt50:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 2.8\n        n: ~500\n      medium_50_200:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 2.2\n        n: ~4100\n      large_200_500:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 1.8\n        n: ~5500\n      xlarge_500plus:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 1.6\n        n: ~5100\n    stratum_pool_size:\n      pool_lt20:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 1.0\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.3\n      pool_20_50:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 2.1\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 1.0\n      pool_gt50:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 2.5\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 1.4\n    stratum_query_pos_sim:\n      high_sim_gt095:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 2.6\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 1.8\n      medium_sim_085_095:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 1.9\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.8\n      low_sim_lt085:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 1.2\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.2\n  result_rationale: 'Structural-available stratum（34%）上 dataflow 优势放大到 +2.8pp（Qwen），因为这些\n    instance 实际接收了 dataflow-disconnected negatives——真实训练信号未被 fallback 稀释。 Fallback\n    stratum（66%）上 dataflow ≈ embedding（±0.2pp），因为 fallback 时 dataflow 策略退化为 embedding\n    或 random 选择，无结构信号注入。这一分解直接回应 reviewer 关于 \"34% coverage 稀释 signal\" 的 concern——真实\n    per-instance 效果是 +2.8pp 而非 pooled +1.0pp。Neg_difficulty Q4（最难 quartile）上 delta\n    最大（embedding +3.2pp, dataflow +2.1pp），符合 representation saturation 理论——Qwen 在高\n    pos_sim 区域最需要 harder negatives，而 Q4 恰好是 margin 最小、分辨最难的 instances。Q1（最容易）delta\n    最小 因为 random negatives 已经足够容易区分。Repo size 上 small repo delta 更大因为 小 repo 的 candidate\n    pool 更集中，mining 策略差异更容易体现。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Stratified R@1 Delta by Structural Data Availability (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - Stratum\n    - N\n    - random R@1\n    - embedding R@1\n    - dataflow R@1\n    - df−rand (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - With dataflow (34%)\n      - ~5.2K\n      - 53.1\n      - 55.4\n      - 55.9\n      - '+2.8'\n    - - Fallback (66%)\n      - ~10K\n      - 55.2\n      - 57.3\n      - 55.3\n      - '+0.1'\n    - - Overall\n      - ~15.2K\n      - 54.5\n      - 56.5\n      - 55.5\n      - '+1.0'\n  - name: 'Table 7b: R@1 Delta by Neg Difficulty Quartile (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - Quartile\n    - margin_mean\n    - emb−rand (pp)\n    - df−rand (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Q1 (easiest)\n      - 0.142\n      - '+0.8'\n      - '+0.3'\n    - - Q2\n      - 0.078\n      - '+1.5'\n      - '+0.7'\n    - - Q3\n      - 0.031\n      - '+2.4'\n      - '+1.2'\n    - - Q4 (hardest)\n      - 0.008\n      - '+3.2'\n      - '+2.1'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 7: Heatmap — R@1 delta (strategy × stratum), separate panels for Qwen and\n    StarCoder'\n  - 'Fig 8: Neg difficulty quartile vs R@1 delta line plot, 3 strategies overlaid'\n  analysis: 'Stratified analysis 提供了论文中最强的 mechanistic 证据。Neg_difficulty Q4 的 +3.2pp\n    embedding delta 是 overall +2.0pp 的 1.6 倍——越难的 instances 从 harder negatives 获益越多，这是\n    representation saturation 理论的直接预测。Structural-available vs fallback 分解消除了 \"diluted\n    signal\" concern 并揭示 dataflow 的真实 per-instance 效果（+2.8pp）远大于 pooled 报告值。\n\n    '\n- name: Call-Graph Hop Depth Ablation (1/2/3-hop)\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '比较 1-hop / 2-hop / 3-hop call-graph bounding 对 dataflow negative 质量的影响。\n    Qwen encoder, 1 seed, SWE-smith validation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    hop_1:\n      R1: 0.548\n      connected_coverage_pct: 12.4\n      negatives_per_query_mean: 18.2\n    hop_2:\n      R1: 0.555\n      connected_coverage_pct: 34.3\n      negatives_per_query_mean: 31.7\n    hop_3:\n      R1: 0.551\n      connected_coverage_pct: 58.6\n      negatives_per_query_mean: 42.1\n    optimal_hop: 2\n    hop2_minus_hop1_pp: 0.7\n    hop3_minus_hop2_pp: -0.4\n  result_rationale: '2-hop 是最优平衡点。1-hop 太保守——仅 12.4% coverage 意味着大部分 instance 没有足够的\n    connected 节点来定义 \"disconnected\" negatives，退化为 random。3-hop 过于宽松——58.6% coverage\n    下 \"disconnected\" 的定义变得太窄，许多语义相关但间接连接的文件被错误排除在 negative pool 外，引入噪声。2-hop 的 34.3%\n    coverage（与 M1 extraction 的 structural data rate 一致）在 \"enough connected nodes to\n    define meaningful disconnection\" 和 \"disconnected set still contains genuinely\n    unrelated files\" 之间取得平衡。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: Hop Depth Ablation (Qwen, dataflow strategy)'\n    columns:\n    - Hops\n    - Coverage (%)\n    - Neg/query\n    - R@1 (%)\n    - Δ vs 2-hop (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 12.4\n      - 18.2\n      - 54.8\n      - −0.7\n    - - 2\n      - 34.3\n      - 31.7\n      - 55.5\n      - —\n    - - 3\n      - 58.6\n      - 42.1\n      - 55.1\n      - −0.4\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S1: Hop depth vs R@1 line plot with coverage % on secondary y-axis'\n  analysis: '2-hop optimal 符合 inter-procedural dataflow 的语义：1-hop = 直接 caller/callee，\n    2-hop = caller 的 caller 或 callee 的 callee（一层间接调用），3-hop 开始包含 过于间接的关系。论文可以强调 2-hop\n    选择有 principled 依据而非纯粹 empirical tuning。\n\n    '\n- name: Training Data Size Scaling (1K/3K/5K)\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '固定 Qwen encoder + embedding strategy，训练数据从 1K / 3K / 5K instances\n    增长， 观察 R@1 变化和策略排名稳定性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    size_1K:\n      random_R1: 0.51\n      embedding_R1: 0.522\n      dataflow_R1: 0.515\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n      seed_std: 0.015\n    size_3K:\n      random_R1: 0.532\n      embedding_R1: 0.55\n      dataflow_R1: 0.541\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.8\n      seed_std: 0.01\n    size_5K:\n      random_R1: 0.545\n      embedding_R1: 0.565\n      dataflow_R1: 0.555\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.0\n      seed_std: 0.008\n    ranking_stable: true\n    monotonic_improvement: true\n  result_rationale: '策略排名在 1K/3K/5K 三个尺度上保持一致（embedding > dataflow > random），但 delta\n    幅度随数据量增大而增大——1K 时 +1.2pp，5K 时 +2.0pp。这是因为更大的训练集提供更多 diverse negatives，使 mining\n    策略的差异更充分地体现。1K 时 seed 方差较大（std=0.015） 因为 negative 多样性不足，个别 seed 的 negative 采样偶然性影响结果。5K\n    时方差收敛 （std=0.008），mining 策略的信号超过采样噪声。No diminishing returns at 5K suggests further\n    scaling could help, but is beyond scope。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: Data Size Scaling (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - Size\n    - random R@1\n    - embedding R@1\n    - dataflow R@1\n    - emb−rand (pp)\n    - σ across seeds\n    rows:\n    - - 1K\n      - 51.0\n      - 52.2\n      - 51.5\n      - '+1.2'\n      - 1.5\n    - - 3K\n      - 53.2\n      - 55.0\n      - 54.1\n      - '+1.8'\n      - 1.0\n    - - 5K\n      - 54.5\n      - 56.5\n      - 55.5\n      - '+2.0'\n      - 0.8\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S2: R@1 vs training size for 3 strategies, with shaded seed variance bands'\n  analysis: 'Monotonic scaling + stable ranking 表明结果不是 small-data artifact。5K 时未见\n    diminishing returns，暗示更大数据集可能进一步放大差异。这对 reviewer \"effect size marginal\" concern\n    有价值——delta 仍在增长，当前 +2.0pp 是下界而非上界。\n\n    '\n- name: Fusion Head Ablation\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: '比较 embedding-only / structural-features-only / combined fusion head，\n    隔离 training-time mining 价值与 inference-time feature injection。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    embedding_only:\n      qwen_R1: 0.565\n      starcoder_R1: 0.475\n    structural_features_only:\n      qwen_R1: 0.498\n      starcoder_R1: 0.421\n    combined_fusion:\n      qwen_R1: 0.561\n      starcoder_R1: 0.472\n    embedding_only_minus_combined_pp: 0.4\n    conclusion: mining > fusion; structural features at inference add noise\n  result_rationale: 'Embedding-only（仅用 embedding mining 训练的 retriever，inference 时不注入结构特征）\n    表现最好或 tied with combined。Combined fusion 略低 0.4pp 因为 inference-time structural\n    features 引入了不精确的 CodeQL connectivity 信号——recall 某些 CodeQL extraction 失败的 instance\n    反而被错误降权。Structural-features-only（不用 mining 训练， 仅在 inference 注入结构特征）远低于 embedding-only（-6.7pp\n    Qwen），证明核心价值在 training-time negative mining 而非 inference-time feature engineering。\n    这一结果对 paper framing 极为重要：StructFuse 的贡献是 mining strategy，不是 fusion。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: Fusion Head Ablation'\n    columns:\n    - Configuration\n    - Qwen R@1 (%)\n    - StarCoder R@1 (%)\n    rows:\n    - - embedding-only (ours)\n      - 56.5\n      - 47.5\n    - - structural-features-only\n      - 49.8\n      - 42.1\n    - - combined fusion\n      - 56.1\n      - 47.2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S3: Ablation bar chart comparing 3 fusion configurations'\n  analysis: '训练时注入 structural signal 通过 negative mining（间接信号）比 inference 时直接注入 structural\n    features（直接信号）更有效。可能原因：mining 让 encoder 自己学习结构相关的 representation，而直接注入 features\n    绕过了 encoder 的学习过程，且 CodeQL 34% coverage 意味着 66% instance 在 inference 时收到 zero-vector\n    structural features，引入 noise。\n\n    '\n- name: Dataflow-Distance Weighted vs Binary Negatives\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: '比较 binary connected/disconnected 与 dataflow-distance weighted negative\n    sampling。 Weighted: disconnected 且 hop-distance 更远的文件被赋予更高采样概率。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    binary_qwen_R1: 0.555\n    weighted_qwen_R1: 0.558\n    binary_starcoder_R1: 0.458\n    weighted_starcoder_R1: 0.459\n    weighted_minus_binary_qwen_pp: 0.3\n    weighted_minus_binary_starcoder_pp: 0.1\n  result_rationale: 'Weighted 在 Qwen 上仅微弱提升 +0.3pp（不显著），StarCoder 上几乎无差异。 原因：binary\n    disconnected/connected 已经捕获了最关键的 structural distinction—— \"是否在调用链上\"。进一步按 hop distance\n    加权引入的额外信号被 noise 抵消：距离更远 不一定意味着更好的 negative（一个完全无关的 utility 文件可能 hop=∞ 但也是 trivial\n    negative）。 Binary 的简洁性是优势——fewer hyperparameters, same effect。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S1: Weighted vs Binary Dataflow Negatives'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Qwen R@1 (%)\n    - StarCoder R@1 (%)\n    - Δ vs Binary (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Binary (default)\n      - 55.5\n      - 45.8\n      - —\n    - - Distance-weighted\n      - 55.8\n      - 45.9\n      - +0.3 / +0.1\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Binary is sufficient — complexity of weighted sampling not justified.","numLines":400,"startLine":150,"totalLines":1176}}}
