{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QBmsaSDz4aCH5YKCvaPENW","type":"tool_result","content":"549\t  analysis: 'Binary is sufficient — complexity of weighted sampling not justified.\n550\t    论文可在 ablation section 用一句话报告这一 negative result， 强化 \"simple binary structural signal\n551\t    is the key insight\" 的 narrative。\n552\t\n553\t    '\n554\t- name: SWE-bench Failure Analysis (50 cases)\n555\t  plan_id: plan_011\n556\t  description: '从 random retriever 的 SWE-bench 失败案例中抽样 50 个，人工分类失败原因， 标注 dataflow\n557\t    信号是否可能帮助。\n558\t\n559\t    '\n560\t  expected_results:\n561\t    total_analyzed: 50\n562\t    category_breakdown:\n563\t      retrieval_failure_wrong_files: 22\n564\t      retrieval_success_but_agent_fail: 15\n565\t      insufficient_context_window: 7\n566\t      test_environment_issue: 4\n567\t      ambiguous_issue_description: 2\n568\t    dataflow_could_help:\n569\t      true: 14\n570\t      partially: 5\n571\t      false: 31\n572\t    dataflow_help_rate: 0.28\n573\t    key_pattern: '14/22 retrieval failures involve cross-module dependencies where\n574\t      the gold file is a caller/callee of a retrieved-but-wrong file — dataflow connectivity\n575\t      would directly address these.\n576\t\n577\t      '\n578\t  result_rationale: '50 个失败中 22 个是 retrieval failure（检索到错误文件），其中 14 个涉及跨模块依赖—— 被检索的文件和\n579\t    gold 文件有高文本相似度但分属不同 call chain。Dataflow negatives 训练 恰好针对这类 confound。15 个 retrieval\n580\t    success but agent fail 说明 retrieval 不是 唯一瓶颈——agent 的 patch 生成能力也是限制因素。这为论文提供了\n581\t    \"ceiling analysis\"： 即使 perfect retrieval，resolve rate 上限约 85%（15% 是 agent 能力限制）。\n582\t\n583\t    '\n584\t  tables:\n585\t  - name: 'Table S2: Failure Category Breakdown'\n586\t    columns:\n587\t    - Category\n588\t    - Count\n589\t    - '% of 50'\n590\t    - Dataflow Could Help?\n591\t    rows:\n592\t    - - 'Retrieval: wrong files'\n593\t      - 22\n594\t      - 44\n595\t      - 14/22 (64%)\n596\t    - - Retrieval OK, agent fail\n597\t      - 15\n598\t      - 30\n599\t      - N/A\n600\t    - - Context window limit\n601\t      - 7\n602\t      - 14\n603\t      - 5/7 partially\n604\t    - - Test env issue\n605\t      - 4\n606\t      - 8\n607\t      - 'No'\n608\t    - - Ambiguous issue\n609\t      - 2\n610\t      - 4\n611\t      - 'No'\n612\t  figures_description:\n613\t  - 'Fig S4: Sankey diagram — failure flow from retrieval stage to resolution outcome'\n614\t  analysis: '28% of failures could benefit from dataflow signal, consistent with the\n615\t    observed +3.2pp resolve rate improvement. The 64% rate within retrieval failures\n616\t    confirms that cross-module dependency is the primary retrieval challenge, directly\n617\t    supporting Claim 2''s motivation.\n618\t\n619\t    '\n620\t- name: Qualitative Examples (5-10 cases)\n621\t  plan_id: plan_012\n622\t  description: '从 SWE-bench 和 SWE-smith 中选取 5-10 个 dataflow negatives 改变检索结果的典型案例，\n623\t    展示 structural signal 的具体作用机制。\n624\t\n625\t    '\n626\t  expected_results:\n627\t    total_examples: 8\n628\t    example_categories:\n629\t      caller_callee_confusion: 3\n630\t      utility_file_distraction: 2\n631\t      cross_module_import_chain: 2\n632\t      test_file_vs_source: 1\n633\t    illustrative_example:\n634\t      issue: django/django#12345 — QuerySet.filter() returns wrong results with nested\n635\t        Q objects\n636\t      random_retriever_top1: django/db/models/query.py (text match on 'filter')\n637\t      dataflow_retriever_top1: django/db/models/sql/query.py (actual SQL generation\n638\t        called by filter)\n639\t      gold: django/db/models/sql/query.py\n640\t      explanation: 'Random retriever picks query.py (contains ''filter'' method signature)\n641\t        but the bug is in sql/query.py (the downstream SQL builder called by filter).\n642\t        Dataflow training teaches the model that sql/query.py is structurally connected\n643\t        to query.py via 2-hop call chain, making it a better negative for other instances,\n644\t        which in turn improves the model''s ability to rank the actual implementation\n645\t        file higher.\n646\t\n647\t        '\n648\t  result_rationale: '8 个案例覆盖 4 个失败模式：caller-callee confusion（3 个，最常见——文本相似的 wrapper\n649\t    函数 vs 实际实现）、utility file distraction（2 个——高文本重叠的 helper 文件干扰）、 cross-module import\n650\t    chain（2 个——A 导入 B 导入 C，bug 在 C 但文本匹配 A）、test vs source（1 个——test file 包含几乎完整的\n651\t    source code 复制）。这些案例具体展示了 \"lexical similarity ≠ structural relevance\" 的核心 insight。\n652\t\n653\t    '\n654\t  tables: []\n655\t  figures_description:\n656\t  - 'Fig 9: Side-by-side retrieval ranking visualization for 3 representative cases,\n657\t    showing file dependency graph with highlighted paths'\n658\t  analysis: 'Qualitative examples serve as the paper''s \"aha moment\" — they make the\n659\t    abstract representation geometry argument concrete. Reviewer-facing value: even\n660\t    skeptics who question statistical significance can see the mechanism operating\n661\t    on real code.\n662\t\n663\t    '\n664\t- name: Temperature Ablation τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2}\n665\t  plan_id: plan_014\n666\t  description: '3 temperatures × 3 strategies × 2 encoders, 1 seed each. 测试 strategy\n667\t    ranking 是否 regime-specific。\n668\t\n669\t    '\n670\t  expected_results:\n671\t    tau_005:\n672\t      qwen_random_R1: 0.558\n673\t      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.577\n674\t      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.569\n675\t      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.9\n676\t      starcoder_random_R1: 0.47\n677\t      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.485\n678\t      starcoder_dataflow_R1: 0.467\n679\t      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n680\t    tau_010:\n681\t      qwen_random_R1: 0.545\n682\t      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.565\n683\t      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.555\n684\t      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.0\n685\t      starcoder_random_R1: 0.46\n686\t      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.475\n687\t      starcoder_dataflow_R1: 0.458\n688\t      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n689\t    tau_020:\n690\t      qwen_random_R1: 0.53\n691\t      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.546\n692\t      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.538\n693\t      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.6\n694\t      starcoder_random_R1: 0.448\n695\t      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.461\n696\t      starcoder_dataflow_R1: 0.447\n697\t      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.3\n698\t    ranking_preserved_across_tau: true\n699\t    optimal_tau: 0.05\n700\t  result_rationale: 'Strategy ranking（embedding > dataflow > random for Qwen; embedding\n701\t    > random ≈ dataflow for StarCoder）在三个 temperature 下保持一致。τ=0.05 绝对性能最高因为 sharper\n702\t    temperature 使 contrastive loss 更有效地区分相似度差异（harder gradient signal）。 τ=0.2 下所有策略性能下降且\n703\t    delta 缩小（1.6pp vs 2.0pp），因为 softer temperature 减弱了 negative 选择质量的影响——当所有 similarity\n704\t    被压缩到窄范围内，hard vs easy negatives 的梯度差异变小。关键结论：findings 不是 temperature-regime-specific，\n705\t    直接回应 median reviewer 的 \"τ=0.05 unusually low\" concern。\n706\t\n707\t    '\n708\t  tables:\n709\t  - name: 'Table 8: Temperature Ablation (R@1 %)'\n710\t    columns:\n711\t    - τ\n712\t    - Encoder\n713\t    - random\n714\t    - embedding\n715\t    - dataflow\n716\t    - emb−rand (pp)\n717\t    rows:\n718\t    - - 0.05\n719\t      - Qwen\n720\t      - 55.8\n721\t      - 57.7\n722\t      - 56.9\n723\t      - '+1.9'\n724\t    - - 0.05\n725\t      - StarCoder\n726\t      - 47.0\n727\t      - 48.5\n728\t      - 46.7\n729\t      - '+1.5'\n730\t    - - 0.1\n731\t      - Qwen\n732\t      - 54.5\n733\t      - 56.5\n734\t      - 55.5\n735\t      - '+2.0'\n736\t    - - 0.1\n737\t      - StarCoder\n738\t      - 46.0\n739\t      - 47.5\n740\t      - 45.8\n741\t      - '+1.5'\n742\t    - - 0.2\n743\t      - Qwen\n744\t      - 53.0\n745\t      - 54.6\n746\t      - 53.8\n747\t      - '+1.6'\n748\t    - - 0.2\n749\t      - StarCoder\n750\t      - 44.8\n751\t      - 46.1\n752\t      - 44.7\n753\t      - '+1.3'\n754\t  figures_description:\n755\t  - 'Fig S5: Temperature × strategy interaction plot (R@1 on y-axis, τ on x-axis,\n756\t    separate lines per strategy)'\n757\t  analysis: 'Ranking stability across τ 是重要的 robustness evidence。τ=0.2 下 delta 缩小但\n758\t    不翻转，说明 mining quality 的价值在不同 loss sharpness 下都存在。Paper 可以报告 τ=0.05 作为 alternative\n759\t    best configuration 但选择 τ=0.1 作为 default（更常见的 literature default）。\n760\t\n761\t    '\n762\t- name: Dynamic vs Static Embedding Mining\n763\t  plan_id: plan_015\n764\t  description: 'Dynamic: 每 epoch 重新用当前 encoder 挖 embedding negatives。 Static: 仅用 pretrained\n765\t    encoder 挖一次（当前做法）。 Qwen + StarCoder, 1 seed each。\n766\t\n767\t    '\n768\t  expected_results:\n769\t    qwen_static_R1: 0.565\n770\t    qwen_dynamic_R1: 0.568\n771\t    qwen_dynamic_minus_static_pp: 0.3\n772\t    starcoder_static_R1: 0.475\n773\t    starcoder_dynamic_R1: 0.477\n774\t    starcoder_dynamic_minus_static_pp: 0.2\n775\t    dynamic_significant: false\n776\t    curriculum_confound_ruled_out: true\n777\t  result_rationale: 'Dynamic mining 仅微弱提升 +0.2-0.3pp（不显著），因为 LoRA rank 16 的 fine-tuning\n778\t    只轻微改变 embedding space——pretrained encoder 的 nearest neighbors 在训练后 仍然大部分相同。这排除了\n779\t    \"static mining 的优势来自 curriculum effect（early epochs 看到 harder negatives 然后 negatives\n780\t    变 stale）\" 的 confound——即使更新 negatives， 效果几乎不变。对 Claim 2 很重要：说明 mining strategy\n781\t    的选择（what to mine）比 mining schedule（when to mine）更关键。Dynamic mining 的 compute overhead（每\n782\t    epoch 重新 encode + kNN）不 justified。\n783\t\n784\t    '\n785\t  tables:\n786\t  - name: 'Table 13: Static vs Dynamic Embedding Mining'\n787\t    columns:\n788\t    - Encoder\n789\t    - Static R@1 (%)\n790\t    - Dynamic R@1 (%)\n791\t    - Δ (pp)\n792\t    - p-value\n793\t    rows:\n794\t    - - Qwen\n795\t      - 56.5\n796\t      - 56.8\n797\t      - '+0.3'\n798\t      - 0.41\n799\t    - - StarCoder\n800\t      - 47.5\n801\t      - 47.7\n802\t      - '+0.2'\n803\t      - 0.53\n804\t  figures_description:\n805\t  - 'Fig S6: Learning curves for static vs dynamic mining, overlaid'\n806\t  analysis: 'Static ≈ dynamic 是 clean negative result，强化了论文 narrative：关键是 negative\n807\t    的 semantic quality（embedding vs random vs dataflow），不是 freshness。 也简化了 practitioner\n808\t    recommendation——mine once from pretrained, no need for per-epoch re-mining。\n809\t\n810\t    '\n811\t- name: Bootstrap CIs for SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate\n812\t  plan_id: plan_016\n813\t  description: '对 plan_003 的 SWE-bench 结果计算 10K bootstrap resamples 的 95% CI， 报告 paired\n814\t    difference CIs 和 p-values。\n815\t\n816\t    '\n817\t  expected_results:\n818\t    embedding_minus_random:\n819\t      delta_pp: 2.5\n820\t      ci_95:\n821\t      - 0.7\n822\t      - 4.3\n823\t      p_value: 0.018\n824\t      significant: true\n825\t    dataflow_minus_random:\n826\t      delta_pp: 3.2\n827\t      ci_95:\n828\t      - 1.0\n829\t      - 5.5\n830\t      p_value: 0.008\n831\t      significant: true\n832\t    dataflow_minus_embedding:\n833\t      delta_pp: 0.7\n834\t      ci_95:\n835\t      - -1.5\n836\t      - 2.9\n837\t      p_value: 0.134\n838\t      significant: false\n839\t    bootstrap_n: 10000\n840\t    sample_size: 300\n841\t  result_rationale: 'Embedding vs random CI [0.7, 4.3] 排除零（p=0.018），确认 embedding mining\n842\t    在下游 任务上的统计显著提升。Dataflow vs random 更显著（p=0.008）因为 delta 更大且 SWE-bench 中 cross-module\n843\t    patches 对 dataflow signal 响应一致。Dataflow vs embedding 不显著 （p=0.134, CI 含零）——300\n844\t    instances 的 power 不足以区分 +0.7pp 的小 delta，这是 expected：retrieval level 的 ~1pp 差异在下游\n845\t    binary resolve 结果上被放大和噪声化。 CI 宽度 ~3.6pp 反映 300 样本的 inherent variance——SWE-bench\n846\t    Lite 不是为精确 delta 估计设计的 benchmark。\n847\t\n848\t    '\n849\t  tables:\n850\t  - name: 'Table 4c: SWE-bench Bootstrap Significance Tests'\n851\t    columns:\n852\t    - Comparison\n853\t    - Δ (pp)\n854\t    - 95% CI\n855\t    - p-value\n856\t    rows:\n857\t    - - embedding − random\n858\t      - '+2.5'\n859\t      - '[+0.7, +4.3]'\n860\t      - 0.018\n861\t    - - dataflow − random\n862\t      - '+3.2'\n863\t      - '[+1.0, +5.5]'\n864\t      - 0.008\n865\t    - - dataflow − embedding\n866\t      - '+0.7'\n867\t      - '[−1.5, +2.9]'\n868\t      - 0.134\n869\t  figures_description:\n870\t  - 'Fig 5c: Bootstrap distribution histograms for the 3 pairwise comparisons'\n871\t  analysis: 'CI 下界 > 0 for both mining strategies vs random 是 EMNLP reviewer 需要的统计保证。\n872\t    Dataflow vs embedding 不显著是 honest reporting 且与 Claim 2 的 \"conditional\" framing\n873\t    一致——dataflow 的额外价值不是 universally separable at SWE-bench scale。\n874\t\n875\t    '\n876\t- name: Inference-Time Graph Method Literature Comparison\n877\t  plan_id: plan_017\n878\t  description: '文献分析（非实验）：与 CodexGraph, LocAgent, RANGER 等 inference-time 图方法的 系统比较。已完成\n879\t    8 篇论文 survey。\n880\t\n881\t    '\n882\t  expected_results:\n883\t    papers_surveyed: 8\n884\t    key_distinction: training-time mining (ours) vs inference-time graph navigation\n885\t    complementarity_evidence: 'All 8 methods operate at inference time; StructFuse\n886\t      mines at training time. The two approaches are complementary — StructFuse improves\n887\t      the base retriever that graph methods navigate over.\n888\t\n889\t      '\n890\t    papers_list:\n891\t    - CodexGraph\n892\t    - LocAgent\n893\t    - RANGER\n894\t    - GraphCoder\n895\t    - ARISE\n896\t    - RepoGraph\n897\t    - CodeGRAG\n898\t    - CodeRAG\n899\t  result_rationale: '8 篇 inference-time graph 方法均在推理阶段构建/遍历代码图，而 StructFuse 在训练阶段\n900\t    通过 negative mining 将结构信号蒸馏进 encoder。两者正交：StructFuse 产出更好的 base retriever，inference-time\n901\t    方法在此基础上进一步 re-rank/navigate。无直接可比性因为 实验设置完全不同（LocAgent 用 LLM agent + tool calls，我们用\n902\t    embedding retrieval）。 Discussion section 应明确 \"complementary, not competing\" 的定位。\n903\t\n904\t    '\n905\t  tables:\n906\t  - name: 'Table S3: Comparison with Inference-Time Graph Methods'\n907\t    columns:\n908\t    - Method\n909\t    - Graph Stage\n910\t    - Graph Type\n911\t    - Complementary?\n912\t    rows:\n913\t    - - StructFuse (ours)\n914\t      - Training\n915\t      - Dataflow (CodeQL)\n916\t      - —\n917\t    - - CodexGraph\n918\t      - Inference\n919\t      - Code graph DB\n920\t      - 'Yes'\n921\t    - - LocAgent\n922\t      - Inference\n923\t      - Repo structure\n924\t      - 'Yes'\n925\t    - - RANGER\n926\t      - Inference\n927\t      - Call graph\n928\t      - 'Yes'\n929\t    - - ARISE\n930\t      - Inference\n931\t      - Intra-proc dataflow\n932\t      - Partially (intra only)\n933\t  figures_description: []\n934\t  analysis: 'Discussion 中用 2 段落即可。不要 overclaim StructFuse 优于这些方法——它们解决不同问题。 Highlight:\n935\t    StructFuse 是唯一在 training time 利用结构信号的方法，且不增加 inference cost。\n936\t\n937\t    '\n938\t- name: BM25 Negative Baseline — Closing CoCoHaNeRe Argument\n939\t  plan_id: plan_018\n940\t  description: 'BM25-based hard negatives 作为第 4 策略，1+ seed × 2 encoders。 验证 CoCoHaNeRe\n941\t    报告的 \"embedding negatives harm\" 实际是 BM25-proxy artifact。\n942\t\n943\t    '\n944\t  expected_results:\n945\t    qwen:\n946\t      bm25_R1: 0.52\n947\t      random_R1: 0.545\n948\t      embedding_R1: 0.565"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4036345-91c5-47f2-9c09-36d0f1b82314","uuid":"de97a085-83d4-4176-885b-d8370b3bcd03","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:07:41.016Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T162530/best/imagined_experiments.yaml","content":"  analysis: 'Binary is sufficient — complexity of weighted sampling not justified.\n    论文可在 ablation section 用一句话报告这一 negative result， 强化 \"simple binary structural signal\n    is the key insight\" 的 narrative。\n\n    '\n- name: SWE-bench Failure Analysis (50 cases)\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: '从 random retriever 的 SWE-bench 失败案例中抽样 50 个，人工分类失败原因， 标注 dataflow\n    信号是否可能帮助。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_analyzed: 50\n    category_breakdown:\n      retrieval_failure_wrong_files: 22\n      retrieval_success_but_agent_fail: 15\n      insufficient_context_window: 7\n      test_environment_issue: 4\n      ambiguous_issue_description: 2\n    dataflow_could_help:\n      true: 14\n      partially: 5\n      false: 31\n    dataflow_help_rate: 0.28\n    key_pattern: '14/22 retrieval failures involve cross-module dependencies where\n      the gold file is a caller/callee of a retrieved-but-wrong file — dataflow connectivity\n      would directly address these.\n\n      '\n  result_rationale: '50 个失败中 22 个是 retrieval failure（检索到错误文件），其中 14 个涉及跨模块依赖—— 被检索的文件和\n    gold 文件有高文本相似度但分属不同 call chain。Dataflow negatives 训练 恰好针对这类 confound。15 个 retrieval\n    success but agent fail 说明 retrieval 不是 唯一瓶颈——agent 的 patch 生成能力也是限制因素。这为论文提供了\n    \"ceiling analysis\"： 即使 perfect retrieval，resolve rate 上限约 85%（15% 是 agent 能力限制）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S2: Failure Category Breakdown'\n    columns:\n    - Category\n    - Count\n    - '% of 50'\n    - Dataflow Could Help?\n    rows:\n    - - 'Retrieval: wrong files'\n      - 22\n      - 44\n      - 14/22 (64%)\n    - - Retrieval OK, agent fail\n      - 15\n      - 30\n      - N/A\n    - - Context window limit\n      - 7\n      - 14\n      - 5/7 partially\n    - - Test env issue\n      - 4\n      - 8\n      - 'No'\n    - - Ambiguous issue\n      - 2\n      - 4\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S4: Sankey diagram — failure flow from retrieval stage to resolution outcome'\n  analysis: '28% of failures could benefit from dataflow signal, consistent with the\n    observed +3.2pp resolve rate improvement. The 64% rate within retrieval failures\n    confirms that cross-module dependency is the primary retrieval challenge, directly\n    supporting Claim 2''s motivation.\n\n    '\n- name: Qualitative Examples (5-10 cases)\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: '从 SWE-bench 和 SWE-smith 中选取 5-10 个 dataflow negatives 改变检索结果的典型案例，\n    展示 structural signal 的具体作用机制。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_examples: 8\n    example_categories:\n      caller_callee_confusion: 3\n      utility_file_distraction: 2\n      cross_module_import_chain: 2\n      test_file_vs_source: 1\n    illustrative_example:\n      issue: django/django#12345 — QuerySet.filter() returns wrong results with nested\n        Q objects\n      random_retriever_top1: django/db/models/query.py (text match on 'filter')\n      dataflow_retriever_top1: django/db/models/sql/query.py (actual SQL generation\n        called by filter)\n      gold: django/db/models/sql/query.py\n      explanation: 'Random retriever picks query.py (contains ''filter'' method signature)\n        but the bug is in sql/query.py (the downstream SQL builder called by filter).\n        Dataflow training teaches the model that sql/query.py is structurally connected\n        to query.py via 2-hop call chain, making it a better negative for other instances,\n        which in turn improves the model''s ability to rank the actual implementation\n        file higher.\n\n        '\n  result_rationale: '8 个案例覆盖 4 个失败模式：caller-callee confusion（3 个，最常见——文本相似的 wrapper\n    函数 vs 实际实现）、utility file distraction（2 个——高文本重叠的 helper 文件干扰）、 cross-module import\n    chain（2 个——A 导入 B 导入 C，bug 在 C 但文本匹配 A）、test vs source（1 个——test file 包含几乎完整的\n    source code 复制）。这些案例具体展示了 \"lexical similarity ≠ structural relevance\" 的核心 insight。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 9: Side-by-side retrieval ranking visualization for 3 representative cases,\n    showing file dependency graph with highlighted paths'\n  analysis: 'Qualitative examples serve as the paper''s \"aha moment\" — they make the\n    abstract representation geometry argument concrete. Reviewer-facing value: even\n    skeptics who question statistical significance can see the mechanism operating\n    on real code.\n\n    '\n- name: Temperature Ablation τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2}\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: '3 temperatures × 3 strategies × 2 encoders, 1 seed each. 测试 strategy\n    ranking 是否 regime-specific。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    tau_005:\n      qwen_random_R1: 0.558\n      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.577\n      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.569\n      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.9\n      starcoder_random_R1: 0.47\n      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.485\n      starcoder_dataflow_R1: 0.467\n      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n    tau_010:\n      qwen_random_R1: 0.545\n      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.565\n      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.555\n      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.0\n      starcoder_random_R1: 0.46\n      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.475\n      starcoder_dataflow_R1: 0.458\n      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n    tau_020:\n      qwen_random_R1: 0.53\n      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.546\n      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.538\n      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.6\n      starcoder_random_R1: 0.448\n      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.461\n      starcoder_dataflow_R1: 0.447\n      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.3\n    ranking_preserved_across_tau: true\n    optimal_tau: 0.05\n  result_rationale: 'Strategy ranking（embedding > dataflow > random for Qwen; embedding\n    > random ≈ dataflow for StarCoder）在三个 temperature 下保持一致。τ=0.05 绝对性能最高因为 sharper\n    temperature 使 contrastive loss 更有效地区分相似度差异（harder gradient signal）。 τ=0.2 下所有策略性能下降且\n    delta 缩小（1.6pp vs 2.0pp），因为 softer temperature 减弱了 negative 选择质量的影响——当所有 similarity\n    被压缩到窄范围内，hard vs easy negatives 的梯度差异变小。关键结论：findings 不是 temperature-regime-specific，\n    直接回应 median reviewer 的 \"τ=0.05 unusually low\" concern。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: Temperature Ablation (R@1 %)'\n    columns:\n    - τ\n    - Encoder\n    - random\n    - embedding\n    - dataflow\n    - emb−rand (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - 0.05\n      - Qwen\n      - 55.8\n      - 57.7\n      - 56.9\n      - '+1.9'\n    - - 0.05\n      - StarCoder\n      - 47.0\n      - 48.5\n      - 46.7\n      - '+1.5'\n    - - 0.1\n      - Qwen\n      - 54.5\n      - 56.5\n      - 55.5\n      - '+2.0'\n    - - 0.1\n      - StarCoder\n      - 46.0\n      - 47.5\n      - 45.8\n      - '+1.5'\n    - - 0.2\n      - Qwen\n      - 53.0\n      - 54.6\n      - 53.8\n      - '+1.6'\n    - - 0.2\n      - StarCoder\n      - 44.8\n      - 46.1\n      - 44.7\n      - '+1.3'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S5: Temperature × strategy interaction plot (R@1 on y-axis, τ on x-axis,\n    separate lines per strategy)'\n  analysis: 'Ranking stability across τ 是重要的 robustness evidence。τ=0.2 下 delta 缩小但\n    不翻转，说明 mining quality 的价值在不同 loss sharpness 下都存在。Paper 可以报告 τ=0.05 作为 alternative\n    best configuration 但选择 τ=0.1 作为 default（更常见的 literature default）。\n\n    '\n- name: Dynamic vs Static Embedding Mining\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: 'Dynamic: 每 epoch 重新用当前 encoder 挖 embedding negatives。 Static: 仅用 pretrained\n    encoder 挖一次（当前做法）。 Qwen + StarCoder, 1 seed each。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_static_R1: 0.565\n    qwen_dynamic_R1: 0.568\n    qwen_dynamic_minus_static_pp: 0.3\n    starcoder_static_R1: 0.475\n    starcoder_dynamic_R1: 0.477\n    starcoder_dynamic_minus_static_pp: 0.2\n    dynamic_significant: false\n    curriculum_confound_ruled_out: true\n  result_rationale: 'Dynamic mining 仅微弱提升 +0.2-0.3pp（不显著），因为 LoRA rank 16 的 fine-tuning\n    只轻微改变 embedding space——pretrained encoder 的 nearest neighbors 在训练后 仍然大部分相同。这排除了\n    \"static mining 的优势来自 curriculum effect（early epochs 看到 harder negatives 然后 negatives\n    变 stale）\" 的 confound——即使更新 negatives， 效果几乎不变。对 Claim 2 很重要：说明 mining strategy\n    的选择（what to mine）比 mining schedule（when to mine）更关键。Dynamic mining 的 compute overhead（每\n    epoch 重新 encode + kNN）不 justified。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 13: Static vs Dynamic Embedding Mining'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - Static R@1 (%)\n    - Dynamic R@1 (%)\n    - Δ (pp)\n    - p-value\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - 56.5\n      - 56.8\n      - '+0.3'\n      - 0.41\n    - - StarCoder\n      - 47.5\n      - 47.7\n      - '+0.2'\n      - 0.53\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S6: Learning curves for static vs dynamic mining, overlaid'\n  analysis: 'Static ≈ dynamic 是 clean negative result，强化了论文 narrative：关键是 negative\n    的 semantic quality（embedding vs random vs dataflow），不是 freshness。 也简化了 practitioner\n    recommendation——mine once from pretrained, no need for per-epoch re-mining。\n\n    '\n- name: Bootstrap CIs for SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: '对 plan_003 的 SWE-bench 结果计算 10K bootstrap resamples 的 95% CI， 报告 paired\n    difference CIs 和 p-values。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    embedding_minus_random:\n      delta_pp: 2.5\n      ci_95:\n      - 0.7\n      - 4.3\n      p_value: 0.018\n      significant: true\n    dataflow_minus_random:\n      delta_pp: 3.2\n      ci_95:\n      - 1.0\n      - 5.5\n      p_value: 0.008\n      significant: true\n    dataflow_minus_embedding:\n      delta_pp: 0.7\n      ci_95:\n      - -1.5\n      - 2.9\n      p_value: 0.134\n      significant: false\n    bootstrap_n: 10000\n    sample_size: 300\n  result_rationale: 'Embedding vs random CI [0.7, 4.3] 排除零（p=0.018），确认 embedding mining\n    在下游 任务上的统计显著提升。Dataflow vs random 更显著（p=0.008）因为 delta 更大且 SWE-bench 中 cross-module\n    patches 对 dataflow signal 响应一致。Dataflow vs embedding 不显著 （p=0.134, CI 含零）——300\n    instances 的 power 不足以区分 +0.7pp 的小 delta，这是 expected：retrieval level 的 ~1pp 差异在下游\n    binary resolve 结果上被放大和噪声化。 CI 宽度 ~3.6pp 反映 300 样本的 inherent variance——SWE-bench\n    Lite 不是为精确 delta 估计设计的 benchmark。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4c: SWE-bench Bootstrap Significance Tests'\n    columns:\n    - Comparison\n    - Δ (pp)\n    - 95% CI\n    - p-value\n    rows:\n    - - embedding − random\n      - '+2.5'\n      - '[+0.7, +4.3]'\n      - 0.018\n    - - dataflow − random\n      - '+3.2'\n      - '[+1.0, +5.5]'\n      - 0.008\n    - - dataflow − embedding\n      - '+0.7'\n      - '[−1.5, +2.9]'\n      - 0.134\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5c: Bootstrap distribution histograms for the 3 pairwise comparisons'\n  analysis: 'CI 下界 > 0 for both mining strategies vs random 是 EMNLP reviewer 需要的统计保证。\n    Dataflow vs embedding 不显著是 honest reporting 且与 Claim 2 的 \"conditional\" framing\n    一致——dataflow 的额外价值不是 universally separable at SWE-bench scale。\n\n    '\n- name: Inference-Time Graph Method Literature Comparison\n  plan_id: plan_017\n  description: '文献分析（非实验）：与 CodexGraph, LocAgent, RANGER 等 inference-time 图方法的 系统比较。已完成\n    8 篇论文 survey。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    papers_surveyed: 8\n    key_distinction: training-time mining (ours) vs inference-time graph navigation\n    complementarity_evidence: 'All 8 methods operate at inference time; StructFuse\n      mines at training time. The two approaches are complementary — StructFuse improves\n      the base retriever that graph methods navigate over.\n\n      '\n    papers_list:\n    - CodexGraph\n    - LocAgent\n    - RANGER\n    - GraphCoder\n    - ARISE\n    - RepoGraph\n    - CodeGRAG\n    - CodeRAG\n  result_rationale: '8 篇 inference-time graph 方法均在推理阶段构建/遍历代码图，而 StructFuse 在训练阶段\n    通过 negative mining 将结构信号蒸馏进 encoder。两者正交：StructFuse 产出更好的 base retriever，inference-time\n    方法在此基础上进一步 re-rank/navigate。无直接可比性因为 实验设置完全不同（LocAgent 用 LLM agent + tool calls，我们用\n    embedding retrieval）。 Discussion section 应明确 \"complementary, not competing\" 的定位。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S3: Comparison with Inference-Time Graph Methods'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Graph Stage\n    - Graph Type\n    - Complementary?\n    rows:\n    - - StructFuse (ours)\n      - Training\n      - Dataflow (CodeQL)\n      - —\n    - - CodexGraph\n      - Inference\n      - Code graph DB\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - LocAgent\n      - Inference\n      - Repo structure\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - RANGER\n      - Inference\n      - Call graph\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - ARISE\n      - Inference\n      - Intra-proc dataflow\n      - Partially (intra only)\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Discussion 中用 2 段落即可。不要 overclaim StructFuse 优于这些方法——它们解决不同问题。 Highlight:\n    StructFuse 是唯一在 training time 利用结构信号的方法，且不增加 inference cost。\n\n    '\n- name: BM25 Negative Baseline — Closing CoCoHaNeRe Argument\n  plan_id: plan_018\n  description: 'BM25-based hard negatives 作为第 4 策略，1+ seed × 2 encoders。 验证 CoCoHaNeRe\n    报告的 \"embedding negatives harm\" 实际是 BM25-proxy artifact。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen:\n      bm25_R1: 0.52\n      random_R1: 0.545\n      embedding_R1: 0.565","numLines":400,"startLine":549,"totalLines":1176}}}
