ed 方差大（s42=0.23, s43=0.50, s44=0.35）需要全数据解释。\n  related_experiments:\n  - exp_id: d062_qwen_query_split_eval\n    role: evidence\n    result: 6/14 done, criterion effect +16.3pp on s43\n  depends_on:\n  - D062\n  - D059\n","numLines":22,"startLine":1270,"totalLines":1291}}}
